mal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ひら砲らじおでお世話になっている、</div><div style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">エフエム山陰さんと</div><div style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">日向坂アニメ部でお世話になっている</div><div style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">関西テレビさんからも</div><div>　</div><div style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">祝花を頂きました！</div><div style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:xxx-large;font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"><br></span></div><div>　</div><div style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">みなさん本当に素敵な祝花をありがとうございます🥲どれもずっとずっ